# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://w3id.org/eudpp#MaterialOfComposition> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The specific part of the Product this material belongs to. Description. \nFor example, in case of a textile product: [Main, Lining, Filling]."@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "part of product material is in"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponentLabel
