<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponentLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Optional human-readable label identifying the role or part of the product associated with the material component (e.g. outer layer, lining, filling, casing).\n\nNote: not defined by ESPR, requested by sectors (textile)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp#materialComponentLabel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "material component label"@en .
